.TH PERFECTSENSED 8 "2026-09-09" "PerfectSense 0.0.24" "System Management"
.SH NAME
perfectsensed \- PerfectSense hardware daemon (hotkeys, AC, optional fan curve)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perfectsensed
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B perfectsensed
is a root
.B systemd
service. It does
.B not
export a D\-Bus API. Apps and scripts control hardware via PerfectSense
.B sysfs
or
.BR perfectsense (1)
(typically as root).
.PP
The daemon:
.IP \(bu 2
watches platform uevents
.RB ( PERFECTSENSE_EVENT )
for
.BR mode ,
.BR turbo ,
.BR ac\-online ,
and
.B ac\-offline
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B mode
cycles thermal profiles (skips firmware\-rejected ones, e.g. on battery)
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B turbo
(AC only) toggles the CPU
.B turbo
preset; a second press restores the CPU snapshot and returns thermal to
.B balanced
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B ac\-offline
demotes
.BR quiet ,
.BR balanced\-performance ,
or
.B performance
to
.B balanced
(and clears a latched CPU turbo governor); remembers the prior profile
.IP \(bu 2
on
.B ac\-online
restores that remembered profile when possible
.IP \(bu 2
runs an optional
.B fan curve
.B timerfd
only while enabled in config (temp→duty points)
.PP
.B SIGHUP
reloads fan-curve config from
.I /etc/perfectsense/fan-curve.conf
and
.I /run/perfectsense/fan-curve.conf
(also done by
.B perfectsense fan curve set|on|off|reload ).
.PP
Debug injection:
.B perfectsense event inject
.IR turbo|mode|ac\-offline|ac\-online .
UI consumers can also watch the input device
.B PerfectSense Hotkeys
or udev properties on the platform device.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/systemd/system/perfectsensed.service
Unit file (also
.BR perfectsensed.path ).
.TP
.I /run/perfectsense/
Runtime directory (fan-curve config / status).
.TP
.I /etc/perfectsense/fan\-curve.conf
Persisted custom fan curve.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR perfectsense (1),
.BR systemd.service (5)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/yPerfectBR/PerfectSense
